-source attachment. Paint mode and Arcade mode can turn a boring chore into a fun game with real life benefits\n\nCleaning has never been more satisfying... with mixed reality! Transform your home into a Dojo with Karate Clean!", "short_description": "the best way to clean"}]}, "developer_name": "Ricky Robot", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kc.rkybt.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ricky Robot", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kc.rkybt.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26409824631943372"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_1520105492656312_6656175596443083182_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TD2KS6IbTswQ7kNvwG4kist&_nc_oc=AdonGGLYYxpZwQh43si4mu7MmWvUjsEbK7tZkS_uTReVvZx9IjkBvchgM1doLrAgEh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRc60eKJtJRPTt-ZSaUtvSEm9UVZW0QAWJDNnQSSd2dmw&oe=6B0327A9"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Karate Clean", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1770837780, "last